---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Contact
description: Contact Westside Baptist Academy in Katy, Texas — phone, email, address and office hours.
permalink: /contact/
---

<div class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Contact Us</h1>
    <p class="page-head__lede">Call during school hours and a person will answer.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid grid--3">

      <div class="card">
        <h3>School Office</h3>
        <p>
          <a href="tel:{{ site.contact.phoneHref }}">{{ site.contact.phone }}</a><br>
          <a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}">{{ site.contact.email }}</a>
        </p>
        <p class="card__meta">{{ site.contact.officeHours }}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Campus</h3>
        <address>
          {{ site.contact.street }}<br>
          {{ site.contact.city }}, {{ site.contact.state }} {{ site.contact.zip }}
        </address>
        <p><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q={{ site.contact.street | urlencode }},+{{ site.contact.city }},+{{ site.contact.state }}+{{ site.contact.zip }}">Directions &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Visiting campus</h3>
        <p>Westside Baptist Academy is a closed campus. All visitors sign in at the main office, entering through the main front doors, and wear a badge while on campus.</p>
        <p><a href="/admissions/visit/">Schedule a tour &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="grid grid--2 u-mt-lg">

      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Who to ask</h2>
        <table>
          <tbody>
            <tr><th scope="row">Enrollment and tours</th><td>School office</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Tuition and billing</th><td>School office</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">An assignment or a grade</th><td>Your child's teacher</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Attendance and absences</th><td>School office</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Discipline and policy</th><td>Mr. Ray Horn, Principal</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Church questions</th><td><a href="{{ site.church.url }}">{{ site.church.name }}</a></td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <h2>Employment</h2>
        <p>Westside Baptist Academy hires teachers who share the convictions of this ministry. Inquiries to <a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}">{{ site.contact.email }}</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Church service times</h2>
        <table>
          <tbody>
            {% for s in site.church.services %}
            <tr><th scope="row">{{ s.name }}</th><td>{{ s.time }}</td></tr>
            {% endfor %}
            <tr><th scope="row">Saturday Soul Winning</th><td>9:30 AM</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p>Visitors are welcome at any service.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="prose u-mt-md">
      {% todo "Map and photo" %}
      <p>An embedded map and a photograph of the campus entrance both belong on this page. A picture of the door a visitor should walk through removes real friction on the day of a tour.</p>
      {% endtodo %}
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
